// Tier W1: `128` overflows a signed `i8` (max 127) even though the negated `-128i8` is valid. The
// bare positive literal is checked against the positive range, so `128i8` is E0044. This is the
// asymmetric signed boundary: only `-128i8` may reach the type's minimum magnitude.
// expect: error E0044 at 6:6
// expect: exit 1
echo 128i8
